  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Unnumbered plate (no printed page number) facing p. 329; upper half is a line chart 'Business' (Wholesale Prices; Bank Clearings, Tokyo and Osaka*; Volume of Railway Goods Traffic*; * Adjusted for trend and seasonal variation; 1923-1933; source Mitsubishi Economic Research Bureau) with no printed figures — not transcribed. This table is the data printed beneath it.",
   "Rows: 32 as printed (7 annual, 5 months 1931, 12 months 1932, 8 months 1933).",
   "Retail Price Index and Labour Indices columns print 6 annual figures against 7 stub lines; by position they sit against 1927-1932, so 1921 (Average) is blank in those columns. Employment column is printed about half a line higher than its stubs; assigned by counting lines within each block.",
   "Labour Indices give no figures for July and August 1933 (blank in original).",
   "Stub ditto marks under 'Average' written as \\\" ; e.g. '1927 (\\\")'.",
   "Oct. 1931 simple General printed '109 6' and Nov. 1931 international '95 8' with the decimal point faint/missing; written 109.6 and 95.8.",
   "No totals printed."
